  epo:definesReviewer <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/9ffee129-f36d-49d7-a337-18ba051428c0-01/Reviewer/ORG-0003> .

<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/9ffee129-f36d-49d7-a337-18ba051428c0-01/ReviewTerm$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot11_TenderingTerms1_AppealTerms1_PresentationPeriod1>
