<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/9ffee129-f36d-49d7-a337-18ba051428c0-01/SelectionCriterion$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot36_TenderingTerms1_UBLExtensions1_UBLExtension1_ExtensionContent1_EformsExtension1_SelectionCriteria9>
